    "No applied wallpaper is available for this display. Enable Animate Lock Screen or Use wallpaper as screen saver in WallpaperMachine." : {
      "localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "No applied wallpaper is available for this display. Enable Animate Lock Screen or Use wallpaper as screen saver in WallpaperMachine."}}, "ja" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "このディスプレイに適用済みの壁紙はありません。WallpaperMachineで「ロック画面をアニメーション表示」または「壁紙をスクリーンセーバに使用」をオンにしてください。"}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "这台显示器没有已应用的壁纸。请在 WallpaperMachine 中开启“锁定屏幕动态壁纸”或“将壁纸用作屏幕保护程序”。"}}, "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "此顯示器沒有可用的已套用桌布。請在 WallpaperMachine 中開啟「鎖定畫面動態桌布」或「將桌布用作螢幕保護程式」。"}}}
    },
    "Unsupported native wallpaper creation request." : {
